#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:385
msgid ""
"The Default Country Code is used to format numbers that don't include an "
"international prefix (e.g., +358).\n"
"\n"
"If left empty, the system tries to detect it automatically from your SIM "
"card or network.\n"
"\n"
"You can manually override it here by entering a 2-letter ISO region code (e."
"g. US, FI, DE) or a calling code (e.g. +358, 358, +1, 1)."
msgstr ""
"Ti Default a Kodigo ti Pagilian ket maus-usar a mangpormat kadagiti numero a "
"saan a mangiraman ti internasional a pangrugian (e.g., +358).\n"
"\n"
"No mabaybay-an nga awan ti kargana, automatiko nga ikagumaan ti sistema a "
"detektaren dayta manipud iti SIM card wenno network-mo.\n"
"\n"
"Mabalinmo a manual a baliwan daytoy ditoy babaen ti panangikabil ti 2-letra "
"a kodigo ti rehion ti ISO (e.g. US, FI, DE) wenno ti kodigo ti panagayab (e."
"g. +358, 358, +1, 1)."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:413
msgid ""
"Carriers limit how large a multimedia message can be. Images and videos you "
"attach are automatically compressed to fit under this limit before sending.\n"
"\n"
"Automatic uses the limit reported by the phone's MMS service, which is right "
"for most carriers. Pick a smaller value if your messages fail to send, or a "
"larger one if you know your carrier allows it."
msgstr ""
"Limlimitaran dagiti carrier no kasano kadakkel ti maysa a multimedia a "
"mensahe. Dagiti ladawan ken video nga inayonyo ket automatiko a makompres "
"tapno bumaba iti daytoy a limitasion sakbay a maipatulod.\n"
"\n"
"Usaren ti Automatiko ti limitasion nga impakaammo ti serbisio ti MMS ti "
"telepono, nga umno para iti kaaduan a carrier. Agpili iti basbassit a balor "
"no saan a maipatulod dagiti mensaheyo, wenno dakdakkel no ammoyo nga "
"ipalubos ti carrier-yo."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:435
msgid ""
"The ringback tone is the sound played (toot-toot-toot) while waiting for an "
"outgoing call to be answered. Some carriers don't generate it so we have "
"option to generate it manually here. \n"
"\n"
"You can select your own music file, or clear it to use the standard system "
"tone."
msgstr ""
"Ti ringback tone ket ti uni a maipatokar (toot-toot-toot) bayat ti panagur-"
"uray a masungbatan ti rumrummuar nga awag. Dadduma a carrier ket saan a "
"mangpataud iti dayta isu nga adda pagpiliantayo a mangpataud iti manual "
"ditoy. \n"
"\n"
"Mabalinmo ti agpili ti bukodmo a musika a file, wenno ikkaten daytoy tapno "
"mausar ti gagangay a tono ti sistema."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:455
msgid "Select Ringback Tone"
msgstr "Pilien ti Ringback Tone"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:463
msgid "Audio Files"
msgstr "Dagiti Audio a File"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:489
msgid ""
"Select the address books to use with Telephony and arrange them in order of "
"priority. The topmost address book has the highest priority and will be "
"preferred if a number is found in multiple address books. You can use the "
"Duplicate Resolver toggle below to help manage duplicates, but even if "
"disabled, we encourage enabling it for a better experience."
msgstr ""
"Pilien dagiti address book nga usaren iti Teleponia ken urnosen dagitoy "
"sigun iti panagsasaruno ti prioridad. Ti kangatuan a libro ti adres ket "
"addaan iti kangatuan a prioridad ken kaykayatto no ti maysa a numero ket "
"masarakan kadagiti adu a libro ti adres. Mabalinmo nga usaren ti Duplicate "
"Resolver toggle iti baba tapno makatulong a mangituray kadagiti duplikado, "
"ngem uray no baldado, paregtaenmi ti panangipalubos iti daytoy para iti "
"nasaysayaat a padas."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:508
msgid ""
"When enabled, if the same phone number calls you 3 times within 5 minutes, "
"the third call (and subsequent ones within the window) will force the phone "
"to ring at maximum volume, bypassing Silent or Do Not Disturb modes."
msgstr ""
"No na-enable, no ti isu met laeng a numero ti telepono ket umawag kenka iti "
"3 a daras iti uneg ti 5 a minuto, ti maikatlo nga awag (ken dagiti sumaganad "
"iti uneg ti tawa) ket pilitenna ti telepono nga agkiriring iti maximum "
"volume, a mangliklik kadagiti Silent wenno Do Not Disturb mode."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:520
msgid ""
"Choose contacts that will always play notifications at full volume, even "
"when the phone is in Silent or Do Not Disturb mode."
msgstr ""
"Pilien dagiti kontak a kanayon a mangpatokar kadagiti pakaammo iti naan-anay "
"a kapigsa, uray no adda ti telepono iti Silent wenno Do Not Disturb mode."

