#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:823
msgid "Name (e.g. Mom)"
msgstr "Nagan (e.g. Nanang) ."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:880
msgid ""
"This is the call volume for each output. The level applies automatically "
"when a call connects and whenever the output changes during a call, and "
"slider changes are heard live. The hardware applies levels in coarse steps, "
"and the earpiece never goes fully silent. The Bluetooth level is stored for "
"upcoming routing support."
msgstr ""
"Daytoy ti volumen ti tawag para iti tunggal output. Automatiko a maipakat ti "
"lessaad no maikonekta ti tawag ken tunggal agbaliw ti output bayat ti tawag, "
"ket mangngeg a dagus dagiti panagbaliw ti slider. Ipakat ti hardware dagiti "
"lessaad kadagiti dadakkel nga addang, ket saan a pulos nga agulimek a naan-"
"anay ti earpiece. Maidulin ti lessaad ti Bluetooth para iti umay a suporta "
"ti routing."

